{"lines": ["Twelve people. Four hours of gunfire. Sixteen officers. And no creature was ever found.", "Kelly, Kentucky, 1955. At a farmhouse, families say small creatures keep appearing at the windows.", "The men fire again and again. Bullets ring like a tin can.", "They float to the ground, then slip away. The children hide under beds.", "The family drives to town. Police and soldiers race to the farm.", "They find broken windows. Holes in screens. Nothing else.", "By morning the family has fled. The creatures came back at three thirty, they said.", "And here's the strange part. The Air Force's own notes list the case among hoaxes.", "Skeptics say great horned owls: yellow eyes, silent wings, two feet tall. Plus meteors.", "So what came to that farmhouse door? Owls, or something else? Tell me below."], "words": [["Twelve", 0.0, 0.12], ["people.", 0.12, 0.56], ["Four", 0.78, 1.1], ["hours", 1.1, 1.52], ["of", 1.52, 1.76], ["gunfire.", 1.76, 1.98], ["Sixteen", 2.74, 3.16], ["officers.", 3.16, 3.64], ["And", 4.28, 4.46], ["no", 4.46, 4.64], ["creature", 4.64, 4.9], ["was", 4.9, 5.32], ["ever", 5.32, 5.52], ["found.", 5.52, 6.0], ["Kelly,", 6.591, 6.8], ["Kentucky,", 6.8, 7.08], ["1955.", 7.84, 8.62], ["At", 9.74, 9.9], ["a", 9.9, 9.98], ["farmhouse,", 9.98, 10.54], ["families", 10.54, 11.28], ["say", 11.28, 11.66], ["small", 11.66, 12.0], ["creatures", 12.0, 12.42], ["keep", 12.42, 12.96], ["appearing", 12.96, 13.42], ["at", 13.42, 13.64], ["the", 13.64, 13.74], ["windows.", 13.74, 14.0], ["The", 14.72, 14.76], ["men", 14.76, 14.92], ["fire", 14.92, 15.24], ["again", 15.24, 15.76], ["and", 15.76, 16.24], ["again.", 16.24, 16.62], ["Bullets", 17.08, 17.38], ["ring", 17.38, 17.74], ["like", 17.74, 18.04], ["a", 18.04, 18.14], ["tin", 18.14, 18.34], ["can.", 18.34, 18.64], ["They", 19.405, 19.46], ["float", 19.46, 19.7], ["to", 19.7, 19.96], ["the", 19.96, 20.04], ["ground,", 20.04, 20.28], ["then", 20.76, 20.94], ["slip", 20.94, 21.2], ["away.", 21.2, 21.56], ["The", 22